or the next document I sent over, yes, was concerning how you set your criteria

00:20:23.975 --> 00:20:25.495
for your users.

00:20:25.895 --> 00:20:28.775
So let's, again, assume we're going with the premier.

00:20:30.290 --> 00:20:35.330
In this case, the admin, that was me at the time, was logged in, and I was setting up a bookkeeper.

00:20:35.890 --> 00:20:39.170
So you originally set up the bookkeeper's password.

